{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753010/extras/2c48b3fc9e6f4346e3cb4a466b111903.avif?t=1749611777\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary staff &quot;Honin Rod&quot; that sealed away the Demon King. <br>However, due to the deterioration of the staff, the seal that lasted for many years has been broken. <br>The Demon King has been resurrected, and monsters known as &quot;Gomono&quot; have appeared, plunging the kingdom into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, the king is indifferent to the suffering of his people! <br>As long as he can eat his beloved pudding, he's satisfied and shows no intention of dealing with the Demon King or the Gomono.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then, all the pudding in the kingdom was stolen by the Demon King! <br>The king, who didn't care about the people's suffering, is now furious because he can't eat his favorite pudding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He orders a search for the descendant of the Hero of Light who once sealed away the Demon King. <br>However, since he announced a reward for defeating the Demon King, countless people claiming to be descendants of the Hero of Light swarm the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He promises to pay a reward to whoever defeats the Demon King first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Buchi, faces a financial crisis because his father's pudding factory had its ingredients stolen by the Demon King. <br>To save his family's finances (albeit reluctantly), he sets out on a journey to defeat the Demon King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's Go?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753010/extras/6bd2ba9f6cd93ae367f22e657dbb177b.avif?t=1749611777\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have heard the name, but don\u2019t really know what it is, and it sounds difficult. <br>This game is just for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The long-awaited Go Fantasy RPG is here! <br>Adorable and colorful characters. Stunning graphical effects. <br>Dress-up items. Battles with monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the essential elements of a fantasy RPG are packed into this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While enjoying the game, you will naturally learn how to play Go in this long-awaited masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">This is the first part of a two-chapter series. <br>In Chapter 1, you will learn the rules and basics, while the upcoming Chapter 2 (the final chapter) will provide more advanced tactics and lessons on the 19x19 board. <br>This series aims to teach you everything you need to know about Go, from knowing nothing to becoming a player.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The policy has been changed, and the game is now designed to teach everything from Chapter One through to the final chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this single title, you\u2019ll master the rules of Go and fundamental techniques!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Regarding Streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming is allowed! Feel free to share your gameplay!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753010?t=1749611777","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753010/9c6e18b61a384fc64f0ee68dd72ddc1742fa5079/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749611777","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753010/d2c18562184970d812830f6b6ac331aa982df521/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749611777","capsule_imagev5":"https: