is family's finances (albeit reluctantly), he sets out on a journey to defeat the Demon King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's Go?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753010/extras/6bd2ba9f6cd93ae367f22e657dbb177b.avif?t=1749611777\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have heard the name, but don\u2019t really know what it is, and it sounds difficult. <br>This game is just for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The long-awaited Go Fantasy RPG is here! <br>Adorable and colorful characters. Stunning graphical effects. <br>Dress-up items. Battles with monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the essential elements of a fantasy RPG are packed into this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While enjoying the game, you will naturally learn how to play Go in this long-awaited masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">This is the first part of a two-chapter series. <br>In Chapter 1, you will learn the rules and basics, while the upcoming Chapter 2 (the final chapter) will provide more advanced tactics and lessons on the 19x19 board. <br>This series aims to teach you everything you need to know about Go, from knowing nothing to becoming a player.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The policy has been changed, and the game is now designed to teach everything from Chapter One through to the final chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this single title, you\u2019ll master the rules of Go and fundamental techniques!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Regarding Streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming is allowed! Feel free to share your gameplay!</p>","developers":["KANITABETAI, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","i